      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I believe they&#39;ve said they&#39;re going to just do oversized villain card sets, so the WotC villains and Wager Master will be available in a set GTG will release later with all those others that haven&#39;t been provided, yet.\n\nThat was my understanding, anyway - could be wrong.\n\nPersonally, I think this approach makes the most sense. There were problems with folks getting a couple here and there but not getting all of them, then the only way they could was to buy the later set, resulting in a lot of (perceived) wasted money / cards. This is a much cleaner, easier&nbsp;way of handling it - even if it means I don&#39;t get my oversized cards as soon as I want...  :cry: \n\n :wink: ",
