      "created_at": "2014-09-16T15:40:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Tangent - Spiff, any chance you'd do non-oversized versions of the Vengeful 5? &nbsp;I see that your .zip file for that expansion has the small HP trackers, but I didn't see a deck-sized Villain Character &amp; Setup card. &nbsp;I'm probably in the minority here, but I don't actually like the oversized villain cards - I really prefer the smaller versions that just fit the deck. &nbsp;Based on an old thread the search tool returned, GtG themselves have no plans to do deck-sized V5 villain cards, so I figured I'd ask if you'd be willing.</p>",
