      "cooked": "<p>I'd be interested in regular-sized Vengeance villain cards too.</p><p>They are the only oversized cards I have, and it bugs me more than I care to admit that my villain cards aren't all the same size. I don't want to buy the oversized pack because of the errors (and let's face it, they are expensive over here in the UK for something that doesn't actually add anything to the game).</p><p>I can almost certainly find 10 spaces in my next Printer's Studio order for the cards.</p>",
