      "id": 118196,
      "name": "Azqa",
      "username": "Azqa",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/azqa/{size}/2015_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-16T23:16:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Really, you want smaller versions of those? &nbsp;I guess you'd just print them and put them in sleeves?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I prefer the smaller versions, yeah. &nbsp;The oversized cards take up marginally more space than a character + setup card, they don't match anything else on the table, they're not any easier for me to read, and they're a bit more difficult to pick up to look at when I do need to read the relevant text (e.g. I can't just pick up the setup/abilities card and leave the character card alone with the HP tokens on it.) &nbsp;Nothing that's really serious, which is why this is just a \"would be nice to have\" request.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well, it's not high on my to-do list, but sure, I can add it to the list.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
